{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_03_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_03","title":"竞走赛","storyCode":"OF-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"6e4240b5cee086d97b6feca6944f6aae7f9a65b7561c97627bc74f82534f32ae","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"烫烫烫！焦了焦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫！我的头发！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，撤退，撤退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，果然还是打架有意思啊，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，博士，我这是为了救你，而且也听你的话没有下重手了，你可不许告诉赫默我打架的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被她知道了我的作业肯定又要变多了！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没问题。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我就知道博士是个好人！"}]},{"label":"作业你要自己努力。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那我可不管！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"源石驱动的火焰喷射器......而且这个功率，好厉害的术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"大姐，你的眼光不错欸，我超厉害的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫锡兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你救了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦......没关系。这，这是我该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，这个姐姐好懂礼貌啊，这种时候我该怎么做来着？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"微笑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"鞠躬。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"跳舞。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，好吧，那我试......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我忘记我的烤肉还在架子上了！我不跟你们多说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，锡兰，你们之后要是想吃烧烤记得来找我啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"竟然直接就跑开了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们也赶紧回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你们平安无事，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"十分感谢您的相助，请问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我赫拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"和博士一样，我也来自罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你现在有时间吗，有些话我要单独告诉你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","aliases":["伊芙利特"]},{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["？？？","赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
